This is a clean-room implementation. It contains no source from
Layr-Labs/d-inference (Darkbloom) or any other proprietary project. It is built
from generic, publicly documented primitives: WebSockets, NaCl/libsodium
(crypto_box: X25519 + XSalsa20-Poly1305), llama.cpp's C API, GGUF, SHA-256
manifests, Ed25519 signatures, and standard platform attestation APIs
(Android StrongBox / Key Attestation, TPM 2.0, Windows VBS, AVF/pKVM).

Bundled and depended-upon components retain their own licenses, including:
  - llama.cpp (MIT), vendored under provider-core/sc-inference/vendor/
  - Rust and Go dependencies as listed in Cargo.lock / go.sum

